<title>DENMARK: Danish Superfos to buy chemicals firm.</title>
<headline>Danish Superfos to buy chemicals firm.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish construction, chemicals and packaging group Superfos A/S said on Wednesday that it signed a declaration of intent to acquire Danish NDH Nordisk Droge Handel from owner Nomeco for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the firm would become part of its Superfos Chemicals unit and that NDH had an annual turnover of 66 million crowns.</p>
<p>The deal is subject to due diligence and final agreement on the terms of the acquisition, Superfos said.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
